</style></head><body><header class="topbar"><nav class="nav"><a class="brand" href="dashboard.php"><img src="../imagess/hydromis-logo-v2.png" alt="HydroMIS logo">Hydro<span>MIS</span></a><div class="account">Signed in as <?php echo htmlspecialchars($firstName); ?><a href="../logout.php">Log out</a></div></nav></header><main class="page"><div class="intro"><div><span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-droplet"></i> Customer dashboard</span><h1>Good day, <?php echo htmlspecialchars($firstName); ?>.</h1></div><p>Manage your water needs in one place—order, track deliveries, view history, and use your rewards.</p></div><div class="layout"><section class="active"><span class="active-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck"></i> <?php echo $activeOrder ? 'Active order' : 'Ready when you are'; ?></span><?php if ($activeOrder): ?><h2>Your order is being processed</h2><p>Keep this page handy to see the latest delivery updates.</p><div class="active-details"><span class="pill"><?php echo (int)$activeOrder['quantity']; ?> × <?php echo htmlspecialchars($sizeNames[$activeOrder['container_size']] ?? 'Water gallon'); ?></span><span class="pill"><?php echo htmlspecialchars(ucfirst((string)($activeOrder['delivery_status'] ?: $activeOrder['status']))); ?></span></div><a class="active-link" href="track_order.php?user_id=<?php echo urlencode($userId); ?>">Track active order <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><?php else: ?><h2>No active order right now</h2><p>Start a refill or purchase a new gallon whenever you need water.</p><a class="active-link" href="purchase.php?user_id=<?php echo urlencode($userId); ?>">Start a new order <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><?php endif; ?></section><aside class="points"><div class="points-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift"></i></div><h2>Hydro Rewards</h2><strong><?php echo (int)($customer['loyalty_points'] ?? 0); ?> pts</strong><p>Earn points on eligible orders and redeem available rewards.</p><a href="rewards.php?user_id=<?php echo urlencode($userId); ?>">View rewards <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></aside></div><h2 class="section-title">Quick actions</h2><section class="quick-grid"><a class="quick" href="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($orderUrl); ?>"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i><h3>Order again</h3><p><?php echo $lastOrder ? 'Start from your most recent delivered order.' : 'Create your next water order quickly.'; ?></p><span>Continue <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span></a><a class="quick" href="../refill_order.php"><i class="fa-solid fa-recycle"></i><h3>New refill</h3><p>Order purified water for your existing gallon containers.</p><span>Set up refill <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span></a><a class="quick" href="../new_gallon_order.php"><i class="fa-solid fa-bottle-water"></i><h3>New gallon order</h3><p>Buy a new container with your first purified-water fill.</p><span>Set up order <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span></a></section><section class="secondary"><a href="track_order.php?user_id=<?php echo urlencode($userId); ?>"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i> Order history &amp; tracking</a><a href="scan_qr.php"><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode"></i> View account &amp; QR access</a></section></main></body></html>
